  "thesis": "A static equal-capital allocation to passive BTC and the frozen DRA V1 sleeve may use otherwise idle defensive capital to improve the risk-adjusted economics of a fifty-percent BTC plus fifty-percent cash allocation without surrendering the DRA sleeve's loss containment.",
